keystone_ur — third-party notices
==================================

Blockchain Commons bc-ur
------------------------
The Uniform Resource codec under lib/src/bc_ur/, and the UrEncoder and
UrDecoder in lib/src/ur.dart, are a Dart port of the reference implementation
at https://github.com/BlockchainCommons/bc-ur
(commit 4479fb81b2350ae8bafa042a5572b9c64c2c32ca). test/bc_ur_test.dart ports
its test suite (test/test.cpp), and test/vectors/bc_ur_vectors.dart reproduces
that suite's vectors.

